<title>USA: Omaha hogs up $0.75/1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs up $0.75/1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $.75 to $1.00 higher. Top $61.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    230-260 lbs    61.00-61.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-280 lbs    60.50-61.00</p>
<p>Sows: Steady. Top 54.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-450 lbs    50.50</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    51.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-650 lbs    52.00-54.00</p>
</text>
